{"path":"drafts/price-match-reply.md","content":"Hi, and thank you for letting us know.

We keep the Acacia Cutting Board (17 x 11 in) at USD 21.50, and we hold the Buy Box on Amazon US at that price today.
If you saw it for less, please send us the link: when the offer is from the same product and in stock, we will match it down to USD 19.60.

A few things to check on the other listing:
- the size is 17 x 11 in, with the deep groove;
- it ships from Amazon or a seller rated 95% or better;
- the price includes shipping.

Thanks again for shopping with us,
The Kitchen Goods team
"}
